6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'll check the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I'll look at the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I'm going for the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
